WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:04.700
Two new colleagues walk home together after work.

2
00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:06.910
Gdzie mieszkasz?

3
00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:09.880
Mieszkam w bloku w centrum. A ty?

4
00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:16.710
After the little word for in, the place changes its ending.

5
00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:19.400
Ja mieszkam w domu z ogrodem.

6
00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:24.490
Super! Moje mieszkanie jest małe, ale mam duży balkon.

7
00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:28.560
Mieszkam w bloku w centrum.

8
00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:35.000
A place that follows the word for in takes a new ending.

9
00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:39.150
To list what a home has, begin with the place.

10
00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:43.380
Then say there is, or there are.

11
00:00:45.580 --> 00:00:47.820
Ask a friend where they live.

12
00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:52.180
Gdzie mieszkasz?

13
00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:56.740
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

14
00:00:58.540 --> 00:00:59.900
Gdzie mieszkasz?

15
00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:05.340
The bathroom is small. Say it.

16
00:01:08.340 --> 00:01:10.340
Łazienka jest mała.

17
00:01:11.140 --> 00:01:14.900
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

18
00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:18.700
Łazienka jest mała.

19
00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:24.100
You have a big balcony. Say it.

20
00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:28.580
Mam duży balkon.

21
00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:33.140
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

22
00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:36.420
Mam duży balkon.

23
00:01:38.420 --> 00:01:42.060
Now practise with the exercises below the video.
